{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":330,"bright":1,"y":-126,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara009_1","addImg":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1a"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":330,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-126,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara009_1","addImg":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1a"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]可可娜虽然不喜欢繁杂的训练……也不喜欢那些欺负可可娜的舞团成员……但可可娜确实对跳舞感兴趣。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]每次跳舞的时候，可可娜都能感觉到身上的压力被释放了许多。[r]或许是只有舞动身姿的时候，可可娜才能感受到片刻的自由。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]我在舞台上跳舞的时候……就有这种感觉……好像也只有在台上会有这种感觉。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]可可娜不记得自己在舞台上的具体表现了，但每次表演结束后，拉碧丝和夏库塔拉都夸赞可可娜跳得好。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1d"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"可可娜","text":"[show]可可娜……是不会被这些夸奖欺骗的……他们夸奖可可娜只是想骗取信任而已，但可可娜只信任自己！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":330,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-126,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara009_1","addImg":"chara009_1_face_chara009_1d"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"yd_009_08-备份","des":"可可娜-自由之舞"}